  "term": "piloerection",
  "definition": "Piloerection is the physical raising of body hairs, commonly noticed as goosebumps. In the supplied psychology research context, it is described as a bodily response that can continue with repeated exposure to the same stimuli and may not closely track a person’s reported emotional experience.",
